This is a combination of 2 different genome references.

I merged the 19 chromosomes from ref 1 with the sex chromosomes from ref 2.

1. Mus musculus strain C57BL_6J_T2T_v1
	- This reference has no sex chromosomes (XY).
	- Tail 9 is problematic (large hole in the middle)
	- Link to the ref: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/datasets/genome/GCA_964188535.1/


2. Genome assembly T2T_mhaESC_v1.5 
	- This reference has problematic edges at the 5' edge: 
		- 2, 5, 14 ,15 ,17, 18, 19 at the first 200,000 bases.
		- X and 6 at the first 200,000 bases.
	- Link to the ref: https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/datasets/genome/GCA_056825265.1/
